@RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5277

### 1. Health Check
GET {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login as Demo Admin
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Pass123!"
}

### 3. Get Existing Requisitions (To find a valid Employee ID)
GET {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions
Accept: application/json

### 4. FR-REQ-001: Create Requisition


### FR-REQ-001: Create Requisition
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior C# Developer",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "employmentType": "Full-Time",
  "seniority": "Senior",
  "skills": "C#, ASP.NET Core",
  "jobDescription": "Backend Developer",
  "openings": 1,
  "hiringManagerEmployeeId": "793a1a0a-0f92-425c-9e29-21ad3d3720bb" 
}

### 1. Submit Requisition for Approval (Draft -> PendingApproval)
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8/submit


### 2. Approve Requisition (PendingApproval -> Approved)
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8/approve


### 3. Reject Requisition (PendingApproval -> Draft with a comment)
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Needs higher budget allocation before review."
}

### FR-REQ-003: Update Requisition (Allowed in Draft status)
PUT {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Backend Architect",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "employmentType": "Full-Time",
  "seniority": "Senior",
  "skills": "C#, ASP.NET Core, EF Core, Docker",
  "jobDescription": "Updated description for lead developer.",
  "openings": 3,
  "budgetMin": 120000,
  "budgetMax": 150000
}

### Test FR-REQ-004: Add Team Member
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8/team-members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "dc6e9794-559c-421e-a4df-234e16dc6e24",
  "teamRole": "Recruiter"
}
### Remove Team Member (FR-REQ-004)
DELETE {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/793a1a0a-0f92-425c-9e29-21ad3d3720bb/team-members/dc6e9794-559c-421e-a4df-234e16dc6e24



### View Requisition (FR-REQ-007: Budget Access Check)
GET {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8


### Clone Requisition (FR-REQ-010)
POST {{RecruitingAts.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requisitions/425a941e-b7b5-41b6-9617-cd9017e8b1f8/clone